========================
Primary output artifacts:
- CONFIG_STATE_SNAPSHOT.md
- CONFIG_STATE_SNAPSHOT.json when machine-readable planning is useful or requested

Required minimum fields:
snapshot_id
source_manifest
source_requests
inspection_context
